# data tree (~8.5 GB): raw NHS downloads, reproducible via src/01-06. The processed dataset
# (data/processed/, incl. the derived panels up to 74 MB - under GitHub's 100 MB limit) IS tracked
# in full: every documented number traces to a csv there. data/reference/ is also tracked
# (2026-08-01 audit FIX-03): rtt_manifest.csv is the SHA-256 fingerprint of the raw files and
# trust_icb.csv is the ODS snapshot that defines is_public and the ICB mapping - both are
# unrecoverable later because NHS revises files and ODS relationships change.
data/*
!data/processed/
!data/processed/*
!data/reference/
!data/reference/*
